    "image_with_text_6BPVwt": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "name": "Media with text",
      "settings": {
        "subheading": "Bioshoes4all",
        "title": "Innovation with Every Step",
        "title_size": 42,
        "title_width": 12,
        "text": "<p>On July 3rd, Monteiro Fabrics opened its doors to host a special demonstration day for the <em>Bioshoes4All</em> project. Organized by <a href=\"https://www.apiccaps.pt/\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>APICCAPS</strong></a>, this open house welcomed around 70 visitors — including project partners and key representatives from <a href=\"https://www.iapmei.pt/\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>IAPMEI</strong>,</a> <a href=\"https://www.aicep.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>AICEP</strong></a>, <strong>Direção Geral da Economia</strong>, and the <strong>PRR task force – Recuperar Portugal</strong>.</p><p>It was a valuable opportunity to bring the industry and institutions together for a close-up view of sustainable innovation in action.</p>",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "text_alignment": "center",
        "text_width": 51,
        "button_style": "auto",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/CTC_Acao_demonstracao-327.jpg",
