    "image_with_text_MNWr6A": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "name": "Media with text",
      "settings": {
        "subheading": "Bioshoes4all",
        "title": "",
        "title_size": 28,
        "title_width": 12,
        "text": "<p>During the visit, guests experienced live demonstrations of our <strong>production process</strong>, from <strong>raw bio-based inputs</strong> to finished materials.</p><p>In our laboratory, we revealed how bio-waste incorporation starts: through systematic experimentation, with over 16 bio-waste sources tested across hundreds of lab trials, dozens of mechanical tests, and several pilot and industrial runs.</p><h3>The result? Three fully viable, industry-ready collections now at <strong>TRL 9</strong> — a key milestone for industrial scalability.</h3>",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "text_alignment": "center",
        "text_width": 50,
        "button_style": "auto",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/CTC_Acao_demonstracao-356.jpg",
        "image_width": 100,
        "image_position": "right",
        "media_size": "cover",
        "color_scheme": "standard",
        "color_bg": "",
        "color_text": ""
      }
