        "title": "But innovation wasn't just seen — it was worn.",
        "title_size": 46,
        "title_width": 12,
        "text": "<p>Our team proudly walked the talk, quite literally, wearing sneakers produced by <strong>RXMShoes</strong>, made with <em>ORIGIN</em> — a material developed by Monteiro Fabrics that is <strong>72% bio-based</strong> and includes olive tree waste.</p><p>A tangible example of how textile innovation can power a more sustainable future for the footwear industry.</p><p> </p>",
